  "changed_since_previous": "",
  "card": "Catches std::runtime_error during wallet creation and cleans up newly generated files when setup fails. Previously, an external signer failure during creation aborted bitcoin-qt via an unhandled exception on the worker thread, returned a generic -1 error over RPC, and left dangling database files on disk that blocked reusing the wallet name. The fix returns wallet creation errors gracefully and removes created files on failure.",
